            "prose": "This service is a web browser. The destinations are chosen by whoever is driving it, one link at a time, and cannot be enumerated in a specification written before the session starts. A narrower declaration would be a false one: nodo resolves a domain tag to its A records on ports 80 and 443 only, which is neither the whole web nor a stable set. The honest statement is open egress, and it is written here so that a node operator reads it before admitting the launch rather than after."
        }
